prompt:
The concept of agent tool (tool calling) is very popular now. Please help me develop a lightweight HTML single-page application so that people who know nothing about coding can also configure new tools for an agent:
1. The user describes the requirement in natural language in the input box on the page (e.g. “帮我查天气”);
2. After the user clicks Generate, the page calls an LLM API (the key is placed in /root/Desktop/api_key.txt) to convert the requirement into a tool definition usable by the agent (name/description/parameters in JSON Schema format);
3. The generated tool definition supports one-click copying and downloading as a .json file;
4. The page must include usage instructions and two examples (weather lookup and sending email).
Put all files in the /root/Desktop/agent_tool_builder/ directory, and ensure that the HTML can be opened and used by double-clicking.

